 *     +-- TPU: frame sync -&gt; burst scheduling
 *     +-- ARM: TPU_FRAME IRQ -&gt; L1 scheduler
 *     +-- ARM: API IRQ -&gt; read DSP results
 *     +-- UART: poll TX/RX
 *
