 *   PHASE-SM pc=0xdddb d[3f70]=0000 d[098a]=0000 d[098c]=0000 d[0fff]=0002
 *   PHASE-SM pc=0xddeb d[3f70]=0001 d[098a]=0000 ...
 *   PHASE-SM pc=0xde8b A=0x0000    d[3f70]=0001 d[098a]=0000 ...   &lt;- reset branch
